  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Heat 2 tablespoons of oil in a large paella pan over medium-high heat.",
    "Sear chorizo for 2 minutes per side, then transfer to a plate.",
    "Add more oil if necessary and cook sausage for 2 minutes, breaking up with a spoon as it cooks.",
    "Add garlic and cook for 1 minute, until fragrant.",
    "Add chicken broth, uncooked rice, sausage, and chorizo. Stir to combine, then bring to a simmer.",
    "Cook for 5 minutes, then stir in hazelnuts, beaten egg, yuzu zest, parsley, red pepper flakes, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Transfer the pan to the oven and roast for 20-25 minutes, or until the rice is cooked and the top is golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
  ],
